name: Exact Review workload and deliberate allowance approval
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
require-env: KUZUSHI_REVIEW_TEST_BIN
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: campaign owned-review
require-live-snap: 30 owned-review | review-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN FINDING REVIEW | exact-review-plan
expect: standard
ask: Does the form distinguish exact observations, selected strategy, omitted context and unknown charges from permission to start work?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: review-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: review-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-5
keys: Tab
live-snap: exact-options
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: options-page-8
ask: Are all actions visible at compact sizes, with readable workload, context, options and explicit call limits before approval?
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-editor
keys: 4 Enter
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-editor
keys: 2 Enter
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Total provider calls: 4 | review-approval
keys: NPage
keys: NPage
keys: NPage
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
ask: Does approval preserve one fixed job without starting it or spending, while showing the exact model and shared total/protected limits?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Review plan approved | approved-jobs
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: campaign owned-review
require-live-snap: 25 owned-review | restarted-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN FINDING REVIEW | restarted-plan
expect: 4
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 owned-review | restarted-back
expect-not: PLAN FINDING REVIEW
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
